THIRD-PARTY ASSETS AND LICENSES

This project incorporates assets from multiple sources under compatible licenses:

1. BICYCLE 3D MODEL
   - Source: "Bicycle Simple" by Pixel
   - Original URL: https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/bicycle-simple-c0e5f00e1f3f47d2b19088ced9b85932
   - License: CC Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
   - Modifications: Rigged and animated using Blender for Unity integration

2. HUMANOID CHARACTER MODEL
   - Source: MakeHuman (http://www.makehumancommunity.org/)
   - License: CC0 1.0 Universal (CC0 1.0) Public Domain Dedication
   - The MakeHuman application is AGPL3 licensed, but assets created with it
     are released under CC0 and can be used freely in any project.
   - Modifications: Rigged and integrated with bicycle model in Blender

3. SCRIPTS, ANIMATIONS, AND INTEGRATION
   - Created by: Sumonity Project Contributors
   - License: CC Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
   - This includes:
     * All C# scripts for bicycle physics and SUMO integration
     * Animation files for bicycle steering and pedaling
     * Rigging work combining humanoid and bicycle models
     * Unity prefabs and material configurations

